# 统一换行符：
# Windows 默认 core.autocrlf=true 会把 gradlew 转成 CRLF，导致在 Linux/macOS/CI 上无法执行。
# 这里显式锁定，避免换行符被自动转换。
* text=auto
gradlew text eol=lf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
